  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Att bidra till delegationens arbete, s&#xe4;rskilt utvecklingssamarbetet, s&#xe4;rskilt st&#xf6;d till alla fr&#xe5;gor som &#xe4;r relaterade till gemensam programmering och genomf&#xf6;rande och utrullning av EU / medlemsstaternas gemensamma strategi f&#xf6;r Kenya.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To contribute to the work of the Delegation, notably the Development Cooperation, specifically supporting all matters related to Joint Programming and the implementation and roll out of the EU / Member States &#x2013; Kenya Joint Cooperation Strategy.</narrative>
  </description>
